WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.020
Big story this week:
there's been a lot friction

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:04.070
between the Trump Administration

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:06.773
and their top health official,
Doctor Anthony Fauci.

00:00:07.975 --> 00:00:10.040
The President's often contradicting

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.760
Fauci's medical opinion about COVID-19.

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:15.280
The White House even sent out a document

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:19.360
detailing all the times
Doctor Fauci has been wrong.

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:20.780
Well, the President insists he has

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:22.610
a good relationship with the doctor,

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:25.110
but I wanted to dig a little deeper.

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:26.850
So here to talk about the
President's relationship

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:30.160
with Doctor Fauci is
Senior White House Advisor,

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.100
Ken Wheatley.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.180
Hello Ken, good to see you.

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:35.013
Hello, Conan.

00:00:35.013 --> 00:00:37.350
I'm happy to answer any and all questions

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:40.828
with 100% honesty and transparency.

00:00:40.828 --> 00:00:42.180
Great, great.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:43.770
Well, no, no, no, no, no.

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:45.060
Ken, Ken!

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:45.893
Ken, come back.

00:00:45.893 --> 00:00:47.520
I didn't ask anything yet.

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.340
It seems like the White House is making

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:51.070
a pretty aggressive effort

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:53.200
to hurt Doctor Fauci's reputation.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.433
No, nothing could be
further from the truth.

00:00:55.433 --> 00:00:57.840
The President loves Doctor Fauci

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:00.740
and his constant stream of buzzkill news.

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:02.960
Fauci's a lot of fun!

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:03.980
Okay, look.

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:05.180
I hear you.

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:07.810
I know that Fauci delivers
a lot of difficult news,

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:09.080
but don't you think America needs

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:11.450
to hear it from someone like Doctor Fauci,

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:14.460
a medical professional who
has a lot of credibility?

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:15.990
Does he though?

00:01:15.990 --> 00:01:18.840
I mean, he's been wrong on
quite a few things, Conan.

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:20.990
Early on, maybe, a few missteps,

00:01:20.990 --> 00:01:24.840
but back then nobody knew
much about how COVID spreads.

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:27.520
I'm not even talking about
his COVID statements, Conan.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:31.107
Doctor Fauci's been wrong a
lot, and it's all in here.

00:01:31.107 --> 00:01:33.240
Give me an example.

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:34.860
Give me an example of
when he's been wrong.

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:38.150
Well, I looked up his office
Oscar pool from last year,

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:41.116
and had had Ford V Ferrari winning it all.

00:01:41.116 --> 00:01:42.810
Is that someone you can trust?

00:01:42.810 --> 00:01:45.970
A lot of people picked
Ford V Ferrari, they did.

00:01:45.970 --> 00:01:49.557
Okay well, Doctor Fauci said, and I quote,

00:01:49.557 --> 00:01:52.457
"That TV show The Office didn't really

00:01:52.457 --> 00:01:56.380
"hit its stride until Steve Carell left".

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:57.213
Okay, yeah.

00:01:57.213 --> 00:01:59.960
All right, that's clearly not accurate

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:01.660
or a good take on something,

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:03.590
but I don't think it's a huge deal.

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:04.423
Hang on, there's more.

00:02:04.423 --> 00:02:06.980
On his drivers license it says he's 5'10".

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:09.170
Okay, that's a demonstrable lie.

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:12.563
And guess what Fauci puts on his hotdogs?

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:15.290
I don't know, ketchup?

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:16.350
Cream cheese!

00:02:16.350 --> 00:02:19.220
And his favorite James
Bond is Timothy Dalton!

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:21.242
Oh my, oh god.

00:02:21.242 --> 00:02:22.290
That's bad.

00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:24.660
Yeah, you know when I saw The Sixth Sense

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:27.090
with Doctor Fauci he kept leaning over

00:02:27.090 --> 00:02:28.967
and whispering, "There's no way

00:02:28.967 --> 00:02:31.710
"Bruce Willis is actually dead".

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:34.130
And I once saw him bite into a zucchini,

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:35.737
then spit it out and say, "Gross!

00:02:35.737 --> 00:02:37.490
"I thought it was a cucumber".

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:38.910
Honest mistake, right?

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:40.810
What kind of a lunatic takes a bite

00:02:40.810 --> 00:02:42.400
out of a whole cucumber?

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:43.233
All right, okay.

00:02:43.233 --> 00:02:45.070
But none of what you're
saying has anything to do

00:02:45.070 --> 00:02:46.830
with his medical opinion.

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:47.970
All right, well okay.

00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:50.030
How can you trust his medical opinion

00:02:50.030 --> 00:02:52.990
when he tells everyone to
wear a protective mask,

00:02:52.990 --> 00:02:56.363
and yet here's a photo
of Fauci without a mask.

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:00.370
That photo is from the 1990s!

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:02.690
He was receiving the
Presidential Medal of Freedom

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:05.110
for his groundbreaking AIDS research!

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:06.630
It's obviously you guys are just trying

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:08.210
to tarnish his reputation because he's

00:03:08.210 --> 00:03:09.930
polling better than Trump.

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:11.830
Well, that's just your opinion.

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:13.950
No, no, that's actually a fact.

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:15.350
Well, as the President says,

00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:18.400
facts are just opinions
that run like a girl.

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:21.450
But as I said, we all adore Doctor Fauci,

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:24.313
and hang on, the suns
getting in my eyes here.

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:26.763
There, that's much better.

00:03:26.763 --> 00:03:30.510
We all adore him and
we are behind him 100%.

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:33.130
Okay, Ken Wheatley, everybody.

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:35.633
Oh, Fauci stayed with
Quibi after the free trail!

